if {RansomNPCvar.HasSpoken} == false:
	Alia: Greetigs! For the first time.
	if {TGO.player_inventory.has("HEALTH_POTION")} == false:
		Alia: Let me tell you about this potion I want from cousin Billybob.
		- Ok...
			Alia: Billybob has been hoging all the potions. Can you ask him for me? He won't even talk to me since I keep asking.
			- Sure.
			- No.
		- Please don't.
			Alia: So Billybob, or BillBill ask I sometimes call him--
			"The Faceless": I just said--
			Alia: --and as much as I expalin why I need the potion. There he goes again!--
			"The Faceless": Why are you still taling??
			Alia: And then, I'm just like well if feel that way, maybe Mom would've--
			"The Faceless": Oh my God, please!
			Alia: So, long story short. Can you ask him for the potion for me?
			- If you never talk to me again.
			- NO! Why would I help you?
			- Fine.
		Alia: Sweet! Let me know how it goes!
		set {RansomNPCvar.HasSpoken} = true
		[end_timeline]
	else:
		Alia: Let me tell you about this potion... wait, you already have it?! Neat.
	set {RansomNPCvar.HasSpoken} = true
	[end_timeline]
if {RansomNPCvar.HasSpoken} == true:
	Alia: Greetigs! Again.
	if {TGO.player_inventory.has("HEALTH_POTION")} == true:
		Alia: You have the potion!
	else:
		Alia: You don't have the potion...
